stration Host tests and Execution tests, with a transitive PostgreSql test join. Host ChoreoTrace explicitly delegates generic ITF limits/value validation to FsQuint.Itf.read, and replay tests call QuintReplay and Replay.run. This satisfies the declared generic correspondence consumer relationship. Production Qualification.Contracts instead opens SDD.Artifacts.TypedSpecifications and pins the SDD.Artifacts 1.5.0 published Quint kernel; its lock and the CLI lock do not contain FsQuint. Do not confuse generic replay ownership/test adoption with production installed-kernel migration, and do not infer a registry consumer defect from the production-only absence.","supersedes":[],"tags":["fsquint","itf","dependencies","kernel","replay"],"title":"FsQuint test correspondence and production kernel have distinct joins"}
